W FPL TEAM(S) 👀 588th LAST SEASON 🙌  NO JOAO PEDRO? 😬","lengthSeconds":"2221","keywords":["FPL","Fantasy Premier League","Let's Talk FPL","Lets Talk FPL","FPL Andy"],"channelId":"UCxeOc7eFxq37yW_Nc-69deA","isOwnerViewing":false,"shortDescription":"Get your FPL Team rated for FREE 👉 https://bit.ly/4mwOxFQ\nWin your mini-league or your money back 👉 https://bit.ly/4vHkijC\nT\u0026Cs 👉 https://bit.ly/3Rxg2oN\n#AD \n━━━━━━━━━━━━━\nIn this video I talk about my new FPL Team/Drafts ahead of Gameweek 1. The \"main\" team, the no Bench Boost Team, the best structure (maybe?), and then no Haaland.\n\nLast seasons rank = 588th!\n\nBest 5 ranks = 588, 1294, 4935, 8492, 9975.\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━\n🙏 Subscribe: https://bit.ly/SubLTFPL\n👍 Follow me: https://linktr.ee/letstalkfpl\n💪 Become a channel member: https://bit.ly/LTFPLYTMember\n📩 Business Inquiries: andy@letstalkfpl.com \n━━━━━━━━━━━━━\nJoin my league 👉 glojzb\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━\n00:00 Intro\n00:35 Main Team - Defence\n06:37 Main Team - Midfield\n11:45 Main Team - Forwards (RELAX)\n22:25 No Bench Boost team\n25:58 My favourite structure\n31:32 No Haaland\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━\n#FPL #FantasyPremierLeague #PremierLeague","isCrawlable":true,"thumbnail":{"thumbnails":[{"url":"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/ZUwCIdszOkw/hqdefault.jpg?sqp=-oaymwEmCKgBEF5IWvKriqkDGQgBFQAAAAAYASUAAMhCPQCAokN4AbgC9xg=\u0026rs=AOn4CLCceIgCCteLz7YL32Nu2xNeOApYmg","width":168,"height":94},{"url":"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/ZUwCIdszOkw/hqdefault.jpg?sqp=-oaymwEmCMQBEG5IWvKriqkDGQgBFQAAAAAYASUAAMhCPQCAokN4AbgC9xg=\u0026rs=AOn4CLAc_z8IDHsmbKcUsSoeZr-eGMG8GA","width":196,"height":110},{"url":"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/ZUwCIdszOkw/hqdefault.jpg?sqp=-oaymwEnCPYBEIoBSFryq4qpAxkIARUAAAAAGAElAADIQj0AgKJDeAG4AvcY\u0026rs=AOn4CLAwvIqGnflZOI2E8UM0kP-UJws0xw","width":246,"height":138},{"url":"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/ZUwCIdszOkw/hqdefault.jpg?sqp=-oaymwEnCNACELwBSFryq4qpAxkIARUAAAAAGAElAADIQj0AgKJDeAG4AvcY\u0026rs=AOn4CLCV0WIWlv8DFChmEvyuxB42F3-Wmw","width":336,"height":188},{"url":"https://i.ytimg