","width":1280,"height":720},"title":{"simpleText":"MY NEW FPL TEAM(S) 👀 588th LAST SEASON 🙌  NO JOAO PEDRO? 😬"},"description":{"simpleText":"Get your FPL Team rated for FREE 👉 https://bit.ly/4mwOxFQ\nWin your mini-league or your money back 👉 https://bit.ly/4vHkijC\nT\u0026Cs 👉 https://bit.ly/3Rxg2oN\n#AD \n━━━━━━━━━━━━━\nIn this video I talk about my new FPL Team/Drafts ahead of Gameweek 1. The \"main\" team, the no Bench Boost Team, the best structure (maybe?), and then no Haaland.\n\nLast seasons rank = 588th!\n\nBest 5 ranks = 588, 1294, 4935, 8492, 9975.\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━\n🙏 Subscribe: https://bit.ly/SubLTFPL\n👍 Follow me: https://linktr.ee/letstalkfpl\n💪 Become a channel member: https://bit.ly/LTFPLYTMember\n📩 Business Inquiries: andy@letstalkfpl.com \n━━━━━━━━━━━━━\nJoin my league 👉 glojzb\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━\n00:00 Intro\n00:35 Main Team - Defence\n06:37 Main Team - Midfield\n11:45 Main Team - Forwards (RELAX)\n22:25 No Bench Boost team\n25:58 My favourite structure\n31:32 No Haaland\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━\n#FPL #FantasyPremierLeague #PremierLeague"},"lengthSeconds":"2221","ownerProfileUrl":"http://www.youtube.com/@LetsTalkFPL","externalChannelId":"UCxeOc7eFxq37yW_Nc-69deA","isFamilySafe":true,"availableCountries":["AD","AE","AF","AG","AI","AL","AM","AO","AQ","AR","AS","AT","AU","AW","AX","AZ","BA","BB","BD","BE","BF","BG","BH","BI","BJ","BL","BM","BN","BO","BQ","BR","BS","BT","BV","BW","BY","BZ","CA","CC","CD","CF","CG","CH","CI","CK","CL","CM","CN","CO","CR","CU","CV","CW","CX","CY","CZ","DE","DJ","DK","DM","DO","DZ","EC","EE","EG","EH","ER","ES","ET","FI","FJ","FK","FM","FO","FR","GA","GB","GD","GE","GF","GG","GH","GI","GL","GM","GN","GP","GQ","GR","GS","GT","GU","GW","GY","HK","HM","HN","HR","HT","HU","ID","IE","IL","IM","IN","IO","IQ","IR","IS","IT","JE","JM","JO","JP","KE","KG","KH","KI","KM","KN","KP","KR","KW","KY","KZ","LA","LB","LC","LI","LK","LR","LS","LT","LU","LV","LY","MA","MC","MD","ME","MF","MG","MH","MK","ML","MM","MN","MO","MP","MQ","MR","MS","MT","MU","MV